              "text": "Over summer, a dam’s water volume reduces from 20 megalitres to 4 megalitres.",
              "marks": []
            },
            {
              "type": "break"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "What fraction of the water in the dam has been lost?",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
