    "answer": {
      "short": "$\\frac{4}{5}$",
      "worked": "Water lost: $20-4=16$ megalitres.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Fraction lost}&=\\frac{16}{20}\\\\\\text{Fraction lost}&=\\frac{4}{5}\\end{align*}$$",
